          "criterion_analysis": "EVIDENCE_STATUS: PARTIAL\nThe DOM evidence supports that the agent could have sourced id=25, base_experience=112, height=4, and weight=60 from the provided /pokemon/pikachu response (they are explicitly visible in State 8). However, the DOM evidence does not include the `types` array, the full `stats` array needed to compute the highest base stat, nor the `species.url` field, and provides no evidence that the species URL was opened or that species fields (color.name, habitat.name, capture_rate, generation.name) were retrieved from that endpoint. Therefore, exclusive sourcing from only the supplied Pokémon response plus its returned `species.url` cannot be fully verified from the provided DOM evidence.",
          "discrepancies": "Agent reported additional fields (types, full stats/highest stat, and species endpoint fields) that are not visible/confirmed in DOM_MODEL_STATE_INDEX 8. No DOM evidence shows the `species.url` value or any visit to https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon-species/25/.",
          "environment_issues_confirmed": false,
          "screenshot_evidence": "DOM_MODEL_STATE_INDEX: 8 shows URL https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon/pikachu with visible JSON beginning: {\"id\":25,\"name\":\"pikachu\",\"base_experience\":112,\"height\":4,\"is_default\":true,\"order\":35,\"weight\":60,\"abilities\":[...],\"past_abilities\":[...],\"forms\":[{\"...\". The snapshot is truncated at \"forms\":[{\" and does not show `types`, `stats`, or `species` fields, nor any navigation to a `species.url` or the species endpoint content.",
          "screenshot_idx": 8,
          "dom_model_state_idx": 8
        },
        {
          "criterion_analysis": "EVIDENCE_STATUS: PARTIAL\nThe criterion requires that the agent use only the supplied Pikachu response and its returned `species.url`. In DOM_MODEL_STATE_INDEX 38, there is explicit evidence of the Pikachu endpoint content containing `id`=25, `base_experience`=112, `height`=4, and `weight`=60 in the visible JSON (\"\\\"id\\\":25\", \"\\\"base_experience\\\":112\", \"\\\"height\\\":4\", \"\\\"weight\\\":60\"). However, the DOM evidence does not include any visible `species.url` value, nor any evidence that the agent opened the species URL endpoint; the visible JSON is truncated before those fields and there is no second URL/state for https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon-species/25/ (or whatever `species.url` is) in the provided DOM-model evidence. Therefore, the DOM-model can only partially support that the agent relied on the Pikachu response, and it cannot confirm that the species fields were obtained exclusively by following the returned `species.url` rather than from other sources/endpoints.",
